.TH "whipper-mblookup" "1" "2021" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
whipper-mblookup \- Look up either a MusicBrainz Disc ID or Release ID and output information
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
whipper mblookup \fI<MB_ID>\fP
whipper mblookup \fB\-h\fP
.fi
.sp
.SH Arguments
.nf
\fI<MB_ID>\fP  MusicBrainz Disc ID or Release ID to look up
.fi
.sp
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.nf
\fB\-h\fP | \fB\-\-help\fP
.in +2
Show this help message and exit
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.sp
You can lookup a MusicBrainz Disc ID and output its information this way:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
whipper mblookup KnpGsLhvH.lPrNc1PBL21lb9Bg4\-
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
whipper(1)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Louis-Philippe Véronneau
